# Boscali Summer: the command net.

@command.event status
[*] Theater update: <title>. Check the event desk.
[*] All flights, theater update. <title>. Details are on the event desk.
[*] Be advised: <title>. The event desk has the particulars.

@command.operation status
[*] <name>. Operation phase: <phase>.
[*] Command to all flights: <name> is now <phase>.
[*] <name>, phase <phase>. Carry on.

@command.insertion status
[*] Friendly insertion touchdown observed. Await ground status.
[*] Ground element is down at the landing zone. Stand by for their report.
[*] Insertion complete. Our troops are on the ground.
